	(text "Flyback 24V in, 12V/2A out, 100kHz. Power stage only: no PWM controller or feedback yet.\nTwo grounds on purpose: GND_PRI (input side) and GND_SEC (output side) form the isolation barrier.\nT1 footprint is unassigned until a core and bobbin are chosen. Pin 1 and pin 3 are the dot terminals."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
